#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(package): Order
example: !include ../../../examples/Order/OrderSetShippingAddressAction.json
type: OrderUpdateAction
displayName: OrderSetShippingAddressAction
discriminatorValue: setShippingAddress
description: |
  This action updates the `shippingAddress` on the Order, but it does not change the shipping address on the referenced [Cart](ctp:api:type:Cart) from which the Order is created.
  Also, it does not recalculate the Cart as taxes may not fit to the shipping address anymore.

  Produces the [Order Shipping Address Set](ctp:api:type:OrderShippingAddressSetMessage) Message.
properties:
  address?:
    type: BaseAddress
    description: |
      Value to set. It replaces the entire address, including [Custom Fields](ctp:api:type:CustomFields) if `custom` is not included. To preserve Custom Fields, include the `custom` object in the request.

      If omitted, any existing value is removed.
